# PDF Processing

- Unlock only with user-provided passwords. No cracking/guessing.
- Never overwrite source PDFs by default. Write `<name>_unlocked.pdf` (+ `_2`, `_3`, …).
- Never log passwords, PDF contents, or command lines that include secrets.
- Clear password from UI state after processing.
- Map engine failures to typed errors (`IncorrectPasswordError`, `InvalidPdfError`, …).
- Keep qpdf behind `PdfEngineService`; swapping engines must not require UI rewrites.
- Generate synthetic fixtures for tests — never commit confidential documents.
